{"id": "1547914510428282881", "channel_id": "1326453691527594035", "author_id": "332573289438380032", "author_name": "moyashi0672", "content": "- Saya is not that good, her only useful card is the 0 cost that reduce the xost of someone's card by 2 but it's just expecting you to draw it early so you can reduce vortice's card cost.\n\n- You don't have any cleanse or dispel, so if the enemy taunt with reinforce then you can't snipe anymore and your whole strategy can fall apart, same goes to situations such as if vortice get void / weakness / stagnation 3 debuffs\n\n- You don't have any draw cards abilities, even though you have rewinding time to draw back previous card played, you need to understand sometimes luck is absolutely pure dogshit and you can draw vortice's card last turn and your whole strategy fall apart again", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T10:19:38.147000+00:00", "type": 19, "mentions": ["252762223288516608"], "reply_to": "1547862681418207232"}
